      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "(March 27) God bless you Joseph J. O'Donnell - with Winnie and all your dear ones. As surmised when phoning last Sunday, I was set for your high Mass on Wednesday but that morning Fr. Guargian whispered to me a little change in schedule in your favor. \"We'll offer the solemn Mass for the O'Donnell intentions next Sunday. Write them to that effect ... \" I wanted to do so that day - and every day since and now its almost time for the daily \"pick up\" So I'll add our simple Easter greeting and felicitations with a hearty God's blessing to all repeated for all the Easter Season.",
      "per_polygon": "(March 27) God bless you Joseph J. O'Donnell - with Winnie and all your dear ones. As surmised when phoning last Sunday, I was set for your high Mass on Wednesday but that morning Fr. Guargian whispered to me a little change in schedule in your favor. \"We'll offer the solemn Mass for the O'Donnell intentions next Sunday. Write them to that effect ... \" I wanted to do so that day - and every day since and now its almost time for the daily \"pick up\" So I'll add our simple Easter greeting and felicitations with a hearty God's blessing to all repeated for all the Easter Season.",
